    "Name": "Battle Bus",
    "Details": "It's a bus. With a lot of machine guns. And even more spikes. Why are there so many spikes? There's a little shrine inside it with a motto that says 'Ride Eternal, Shiny & Chrome.'\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 6/9 hexes / 180/270 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       125     20\n<b>Left</b>         100     20\n<b>Right</b>       100     20\n<b>Rear</b>         90     20\n<b>Turret</b>       70     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      485    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - MG</color>",
